AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MSIO_0000062 "Cell seeding density is a measurement datum which denotes the number of cells per surface area in the case of adherent cells or number of cells per volume in the case of free cells deposited in the culture vessel to start a cell culture. The cell seeding density is therefore stated in number of cells per cm2 or number of cells per ml."@en)
