AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MSIO_0000070 "metabolite pool size estimate is an information entity used in fluxomics studies to estimate the amount of  molecular entity available to a particular metabolic process. It is usually reported in umol per mg of protein."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:MSIO_0000070 "can be also computed from simulation and be output of such simulation (then provide confidence indicator)
"@en)
