AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MSIO_0000074 "signal intensity is a kind of measurement providing an estimate of the strength of a phenomena as it is recorded. For digital detector instrument, the signal intensity is usually a electric intensity or a field strength of the electromagnetic wave transmitting a signal.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:MSIO_0000074 "Philippe Rocca-Serra"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:MSIO_0000074 "EU H2020 PhenoMenAl"@en)
