# Class: obo:MSIO_0000127 (flux balance analysis)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000112 obo:MSIO_0000127 "")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:MSIO_0000127 obo:IAO_0000122)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MSIO_0000127 "Flux balance analysis is a mathematical approach for analyzing the flow of metabolites through a metabolic network. Flux balance analysis calculates the flow of metabolites through a metabolic network, thereby making it possible to predict the growth rate of an organism or the rate of production of a biotechnologically important metabolite.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:MSIO_0000127 "Philippe Rocca-Serra"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:MSIO_0000127 "What is flux balance analysis?
Jeffrey D. Orth, Ines Thiele, and Bernhard Ø. Palsson

Nat Biotechnol. 2010 Mar; 28(3): 245–248.
doi:  10.1038/nbt.1614")
